# ＋'s recent photos (Attach.kt RecentPhotos): the gallery read (a photo put in it before, the permission granted as a
# person who said yes has it), its latest across the top after the camera; one tapped goes into the draft and up at
# once; sent with words. Android only: the other hosts have no gallery.
#only android
#before android-gallery e2e-photo.jpg
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap icon:plus
until =文件
# the gallery's latest across the top, drawn
decoded e2e-photo.jpg
shot 1-strip
tapxy 150 -180
timeout 120000
gone 正在上传
shot 2-picked
tap 发消息
type 最近的照片 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
empty
until 最近的照片 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 3-sent
